1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,367
Can you sign a seven?

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,733
Thumb on your ring finger...

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:04,367
three fingers UP.

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,633
Pinky sinking?

5
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:06,730
Congrats.

6
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,200
You just signed...

7
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,167
TWO.

8
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,352
Now bend the ring finger

9
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:11,233
slowly.

10
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,567
Feel the pinky follow?

11
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,011
Inside, their cords

12
00:00:14,011 --> 00:00:15,267
are tied together...

13
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,200
like chariot REINS!

14
00:00:17,243 --> 00:00:17,981
One violinist

15
00:00:17,981 --> 00:00:18,693
had a surgeon

16
00:00:18,693 --> 00:00:20,233
snip every tie...

17
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,100
in BOTH hands.

18
00:00:22,152 --> 00:00:23,267
Free fingers!

19
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,379
He could type...

20
00:00:24,379 --> 00:00:25,733
SUPER fast.

21
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,270
Now sign your seven...

22
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,380
FAST.

